  "capitulo": 8,
  "titulo_es": "Quería que vinieras",
  "titulo": { "en": "I wanted you to come" },
  "intro": { "en": "A wish in the past uses the imperfect subjunctive." },
  "palabras": {
    "quería": { "en": "I wanted, he/she wanted", "pron": "ke-RI-a", "cat": "verb" },
    "vinieras": { "en": "you came (past subjunctive)", "pron": "bi-NIE-ras", "cat": "verb" },
    "hablaras": { "en": "you spoke (past subjunctive)", "pron": "a-BLA-ras", "cat": "verb" },
    "pidió": { "en": "he/she asked, requested", "pron": "pi-DYO", "cat": "verb" },
    "llamara": { "en": "I/he/she called (past subjunctive)", "pron": "ya-MA-ra", "cat": "verb" },
    "que": { "en": "that", "pron": "ke", "cat": "conjunction" },
    "ayer": { "en": "yesterday", "pron": "a-YER", "cat": "adverb" }
  },
  "bloques": [
    {
      "tipo": "explicacion",
      "titulo": "The wish was in the past",
      "texto": "Present wish: quiero que **vengas**.\n\nPast wish: quería que **vinieras**.\n\nTake the **ellos** form of the indefinido, drop **-ron**, add **-ra**: hablaron → habla**ra**, vinieron → vinie**ra**, pidieron → pidie**ra**.\n\nMe **pidió que llamara**. The request was in the past, so the second verb is past too."
    },
    {
      "tipo": "dialogo",
      "titulo": "Yesterday's plan",
      "frases": [
        {
          "quien": "Lucía",
          "es": "Quería que vinieras ayer.",
          "en": "I wanted you to come yesterday.",
          "analisis": [
            ["Quería", "I wanted"],
            ["que vinieras", "that you came"],
            ["ayer", "yesterday"]
          ]
        },
        {
          "quien": "Pablo",
          "es": "Quería venir, pero trabajé.",
          "en": "I wanted to come, but I worked.",
          "nota": "Same person: infinitive, even in the past. Quería venir.",
          "analisis": [
            ["Quería venir", "I wanted to come"],
            ["pero trabajé", "but I worked"]
          ]
        },
        {
          "quien": "Lucía",
          "es": "Ana me pidió que llamara.",
          "en": "Ana asked me to call.",
          "analisis": [
            ["Ana", "subject"],
            ["me pidió", "asked me"],
            ["que llamara", "that I called"]
          ]
        },
        {
          "quien": "Pablo",
          "es": "Quería que hablaras con ella.",
          "en": "I wanted you to speak with her.",
          "analisis": [
            ["Quería", "I wanted"],
            ["que hablaras", "that you spoke"],
            ["con ella", "with her"]
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tipo": "vocabulario",
